SUMMARY:Lara v0.2
DESCRIPTION:lara 0.2 | lara_v0.2\n\n## UX Changes\n- Moved tweaks into its 
 own accessible section\, and put Tools there at the bottom.\n- Moved logs 
 out of the tab bar and into a toolbar item at the top of the primary views
  (you can change this back in settings).\n- Settings has been completed re
 organized\, with some new customization toggles for the app itself.\n\n## 
 Applying/Handling\n- Fixed kernelcache weirdness (kernelcache is now fetch
 ed locally)\n- Hybrid will now be used by default.\n\n## Tweaks\n- Rewrote
  MobileGestalt View + Added a ton of tweaks! (thanks @jurre111)\n- Rewrote
  Liquid Glass View with nice previewer.\n- Fixed Passcode + Add repo viewe
 r (thanks @neonmodder123)\n- Add SpringBoard Customizer (thanks @leminlime
 z and Cowabunga\, as well as @jurre111 for fixing the view)\n- Add SystemC
 olor patcher.
URL:https://raynmahbub.github.io/OmniSource/feeds/lara.json
